/*
 * Youniversal - color system.
 *
 * The three palettes below are generated by `tools/palette_lab.py`, which derives
 * every role from a tonal ramp (CIE L*a*b*, D65) the way Material You does, then
 * asserts WCAG 2.1 contrast of at least 4.5:1 for every text/surface pairing
 * Youniversal ships. Regenerate with:
 *
 *     python3 tools/palette_lab.py
 */

